# ═══════════════════════════════════════
# 3QRIS API Documentation
# Bisa langsung di-run pake VS Code REST Client
# ═══════════════════════════════════════
# Install: https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=humao.rest-client

### ─────────────────────────────────────
### 🔧 SETTINGS — Ganti sesuai server kamu
### ─────────────────────────────────────

### Ganti base URL sesuai server 3QRIS kamu
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001

### Ganti API Key — set di .env PAYMENT_API_KEY
@apiKey = your-payment-api-key-here

### ─────────────────────────────────────
### 🏥 HEALTH CHECK
### ─────────────────────────────────────

### Cek status API
GET {{baseUrl}}/api

### ─────────────────────────────────────
### 🔐 AUTH
### ─────────────────────────────────────

### Register akun baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "demo123"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "demo123"
}

### Simpan token untuk request selanjutnya
# (REST Client auto-save variable dari response)
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Verifikasi token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────
### 💳 PAYMENT API (External Developer)
### ─────────────────────────────────────

### Generate QRIS dinamis + payment link
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-link
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qris": "00020101021126680012ID.CO.BANKMANDIRI.WWW0118936006726031031000102235004216002610ID.CO.BANKMANDIRI...5802ID5913TOKO MAJU JAYA6007JAKARTA61051234562070703...6304",
  "name": "Indomie Goreng + Telur",
  "price": 15000,
  "kode_unik_digits": 3
}

### Response:
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "qris_string": "000201010212...",
#     "amount": 15123,
#     "base_price": 15000,
#     "kode_unik": 123,
#     "product": "Indomie Goreng + Telur",
#     "payment_url": "https://serverkamu/pay?d=eyJx..."
#   }
# }

### ─────────────────────────────────────
### 🛒 CONFIG (Butuh Login)
### ─────────────────────────────────────

### Simpan config QRIS & produk
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qrisString": "000201010211...",
  "products": [
    { "name": "Voucher 1 Hari", "price": 6500 },
    { "name": "Voucher 7 Hari", "price": 35000 },
    { "name": "Indomie", "price": 15000 }
  ]
}

### Load config
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/load
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────
### 📋 TRANSACTIONS (Butuh Login)
### ─────────────────────────────────────

### Simpan transaksi
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transaction
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Indomie Goreng",
  "price": 15000,
  "time": "07:45"
}

### Riwayat transaksi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────
### 👑 ADMIN (Admin Only)
### ─────────────────────────────────────

### Statistik dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Daftar user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Semua transaksi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
